      "en": "The silver is mine, and the gold is mine,’ says the LORD of Armies.",
      "ko": "은도 내 것이요 금도 내 것이니라 만군의 여호와의 말이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "81834f77749bec2182cc2d150ed1e813bf0da5842edc49eedc64a5180832d2f0",
      "translation_text_hash": "ede089c49f5eb8cc7fd934a8e410cf0ebd1fb0df419bac9aa77c1ba526516dd4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
